Korean Word Lookup

The extension source code is distributed under the MIT License.

Dictionary and translation results are retrieved at runtime from external
providers and are not bundled with this repository. Korean dictionary data is
provided by the National Institute of Korean Language's Basic Korean
Dictionary (KRDICT). Google Translate and KRDICT content remain subject to
their respective provider terms.

Korean Basic Dictionary (KRDICT) text
Dictionary text is provided by the National Institute of Korean Language.
The provider states that text content is available under CC BY-SA 2.0 Korea:
https://krdict.korean.go.kr/kor/openApi/openApiRegister
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/
Multimedia has separate licensing and is not included in this extension.
Provider results remain transient; the notebook stores source words and user-authored notes.
Google Translate results and any browser on-device translation are separately labeled.
This extension is independent and does not claim endorsement by these providers.
